{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_49_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_49","textTraditional":"一、二十年，春王二月，夫人姜氏如莒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_49_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_49","textTraditional":"二、夏，齊大災。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_49_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_49","textTraditional":"大災者何？大瘠也。大瘠者何？〈疒列〉也。何以書？記災也。外災不書，此何以書？及我也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_49_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_49","textTraditional":"三、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_49_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_49","textTraditional":"四、冬，齊人伐戎。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}